# ============================================================
# Local provider verification reports
# ============================================================

# Sprint/audit planning history is tracked as durable project history;
# everything else under reports/ stays ignored. (Scope: read-only
# remediation mission; files are NOT staged by this change. Scrub the
# checkout-local absolute paths in these files before any future push.)
reports/*
!reports/audit-acceptance-and-disposition.md
!reports/remediation-roadmap-and-gates.md
!reports/pre-roadmap-audit.md
!reports/implementation_12h.md
!reports/my_scorecard.md
# R1 attested set (REPORTS-MANIFEST.sha256 EXPLICIT_INCLUDE): narrow per-file
# exceptions so the full 13-file set is trackable. reports/* still ignores
# everything else, including documented exclusions (mission-state JSON,
# reports/reconciliation-2026-10-31.md, reports/evidence/). Governance
# decision required to add any further file.
!reports/mission-c-evidence-audit-2026-10-26.md
!reports/mission-runlog-2026-10-26T095838.md
!reports/mobilization-reconciliation-2026-10-26.md
!reports/part-i-sprints-1-8-overnight-report-2026-10-26.md
!reports/provider_verification.json
!reports/r02-kill-switch-remediation.md
!reports/reconciliation-plan.md
!reports/sprint-02b-unattended-core.md
# Scan output artifacts from temporary mobilization
artifacts/production-readiness/scan-outputs/
